{"id":"kptsx7r1vwfb4344lk1c1opgv","title":"机构今日抛售上海电影等26股，买入粤芯半导体3.01亿元","originalTitle":null,"summary":"11月12日，机构净买入粤芯半导体3.01亿元，同时净卖出上海电影2.43亿元。当日机构净买入前三的股票还包括英力特和凯撒文化，净买入金额分别为4325万元和3753万元；净卖出前三的股票则为上海电影、福莱新材和杰克科技，净流出金额分别为2.43亿元、2.23亿元和2.07亿元。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"36氪"},"links":{"original":"https://36kr.com/newsflashes/4066641191474050?f=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T10:49:16.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T10:58:11.989Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T10:58:11.989Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":12,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"dd004a6c-d1a9-4b94-ace4-aba9ae636f91","title":"机构单日抛售26股买入粤芯半导体3.01亿"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"dd004a6c-d1a9-4b94-ace4-aba9ae636f91","title":"机构单日抛售26股买入粤芯半导体3.01亿"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f0fHZzozypSE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}